      "statement": "The observability stack is configured for local use: ports 9100, 9090 and 3000 bind to 127.0.0.1, reports/ is mounted read-only into Node Exporter, Grafana requires GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD and disables sign-up, and Prometheus retention is 7 days, which is the one documented LGPD retention value enforced in configuration.",
