    {
      "id": "claim_6af9dae477ac467fb17808a5d97f8c78",
      "statement": "The README documents an LGPD plan as intent rather than audited compliance: personal-data inventory, legal bases (art. 7 X and V), art. 18 and 20 data-subject rights, controller/operator/DPO roles, retention periods (project data deleted at end, 5 years negative information, 15 years repayment history), and a future-work list that still includes recording minimization, purpose, legal-basis, access-control and retention policies. Pseudonymization of SK_ID_CURR and individual explanations are production plans not implemented in code.",
      "evidence": [
