    {
      "id": "claim_a269dd3fc25d448dba4ca4b744e9c2ba",
      "statement": "Fairness checking is exploratory: train.py computes ROC-AUC by gender (F/M only) and age band (lt30, 30_44, 45_59, 60_plus) on the validation hold-out, skipping groups with fewer than 30 positives or a single class, and logs them to MLflow. Reported AUCs show the largest gap for the 60+ group (0.7290), and the README states this does not prove fairness and that proxies such as income or occupation may exist. AGE_YEARS remains a model feature.",
