      "statement": "Documented limitations of the baseline and drift experiment: the F1 threshold (0.1432) is chosen on the same validation set used to report F1; the production base is a random split rather than a later period; drift is a synthetic stress scenario on two columns with 5,000-row samples and a demonstrative PSI threshold of 0.20; score-impact results do not prove degradation or causality.",
